<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77726" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰπαῖ</span></b>  (not <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παπαί</span>, Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
			2.933
		</span></i>), exclam. of suffering, whether mental, as <i><span class="en">
			A.
			<u>Pers.</u>
			1031
		</span></i>, or (more freq.) physical, <i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Ach.</u>
			1214
		</span></i>, etc.; doubled, A.l.c., <i><span class="en">
			<u>Ag.</u>
			1114
		</span></i>; <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φεῦ παπαῖ, παπαῖ μάλ᾽ αὖθις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					792
				</span></i>
			; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παππαπαππαπαῖ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				754
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παπαῖ, ἀπαππαπαῖ, παπᾶ παπᾶ
				παπᾶ παπαῖ</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				746
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of surprise,
				<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				8.26
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π., οἷον λέγεις</span> you
			don't say so!, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				704c
			</span></i>; also 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παπαπαπαῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					1191
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παπαῖ τῶν ἐπαίνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cont.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			; expressing scorn, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				153
			</span></i>.</div>
